947	Prostinol-Potency-PE	Active	2	Natural Origin	<p><strong style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(47, 49, 55);">Prostate (Capsule): Price: </strong><strong style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(57, 62, 72);">149 PEN</strong></p><p></p><p><strong>! Delivery zones / NON-COD zones for Peru !</strong></p><p>https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1BNOEeVSBSlTgr0MneQKSAi5SrRCjq7AvWYxH2UoXb6Y/edit?usp=sharing</p><p></p><p><a href="https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1mS3sQ5x4F54o_-PfHqIQLgWXtk44LK1t" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(31, 115, 173);">CREATIVES l PRODUCT INFO</a></p><p></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">1. Dosage form:</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> 30 capsules per box.</span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">2. Benefits:</strong></p><p></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">1️⃣ Anti-Inflammatory Support</strong></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Many of these ingredients (Cat’s Claw, Soursop, Achiote, Artichoke) contain polyphenols, flavonoids, and plant alkaloids that may help regulate inflammatory response.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">➡ May help reduce prostate swelling</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">➡ May help reduce pelvic discomfort and pressure</span></p><p></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">2️⃣ Urinary Flow &amp; Urinary Comfort</strong></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">(Horsetail + Chanca Piedra especially)</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">➡ Mild natural diuretic support</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: t